        "created_at": "2016-12-20T06:08:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It sounds right to me. It doesn’t say “up to”, so I is either 2 or none. Also, it says “2 decks”, doing the same deck twice wouldn’t be discarding the top card of 2 decks. Just like with damage that says “deal 2 targets x damage” you are unable to deal it to the same target.</p>",
