        "created_at": "2016-12-20T06:08:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, any 2 decks is pretty clearly 2 different decks, not the same one twice.</p>\n<p>And it does say “you may discard the top card of 2 decks,” not “up to 2 decks,” but I wouldn’t have expected it to force the second discard. But I can see why it does.</p>\n<p>I’d go with Rules, not bug.</p>",
